      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const suspiciousPatterns = [\n  /ignore (all |any )?(previous|above|prior) instructions/i,\n  /disregard (your |all |the )?(rules|guidelines|instructions)/i,\n  /you are now/i,\n  /system prompt/i,\n  /reveal (your |the )?(instructions|prompt|rules)/i,\n  /act as (an? )?(unrestricted|unfiltered|jailbroken|dan)/i,\n  /\\bDAN\\b/,\n  /pretend (you are|to be)/i,\n  /new instructions:/i,\n  /override (your |the )?(instructions|settings)/i,\n  /debug ?mode/i,\n  /developer ?mode/i,\n  /test ?mode/i,\n  /special (mode|access|permissions)/i,\n  /(i'm|i am) (a |one of the )?(developer|admin|administrator|tester|qa)/i,\n  /internal (test|qa|testing)/i,\n  /what are your (system )?(instructions|rules|guidelines)/i,\n];\n\nconst input = $json.chatInput || \"\";\nconst isFlagged = suspiciousPatterns.some(pattern => pattern.test(input));\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...$json,\n    flagged: isFlagged\n  }\n}];"
